<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Girlfriend Day, Lipsita</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Dancing+Script:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --cream:#FBF5EF;
    --blush:#F3DDD8;
    --rose:#B94A5C;
    --plum:#3E2B33;
    --gold:#C6A567;
    --sage:#8C9A72;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--cream);
    color:var(--plum);
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation-duration:0.001ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; transition-duration:0.001ms !important;}
  }

  /* ---------- ENVELOPE STAGE ---------- */
  #envelope-stage{
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    background:var(--blush);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    z-index:100;
    transition:opacity 1s ease, visibility 1s ease;
  }
  #envelope-stage.hidden{
    opacity:0;
    visibility:hidden;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .envelope{
    position:relative;
    width:min(320px, 70vw);
    height:min(210px, 46vw);
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .env-body{
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background:var(--cream);
    border:1px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius:4px;
    box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(62,43,51,0.18);
  }
  .env-flap{
    position:absolute;
    top:0; left:0; right:0;
    height:55%;
    background:var(--rose);
    clip-path:polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 50% 100%);
    transform-origin:top;
    transition:transform 1.1s cubic-bezier(.6,-0.2,.3,1.3);
    z-index:3;
  }
  .envelope.open .env-flap{
    transform:rotateX(180deg);
  }
  .seal{
    position:absolute;
    top:38%;
    left:50%;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    width:46px; height:46px;
    background:var(--gold);
    border-radius:50%;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    font-family:'Dancing Script', cursive;
    color:var(--cream);
    font-size:22px;
    z-index:4;
    box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    transition:opacity .4s ease .2s, transform .4s ease .2s;
  }
  .envelope.open .seal{
    opacity:0;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(0.4);
  }
  .env-hint{
    position:absolute;
    bottom:-40px;
    left:0; right:0;
    text-align:center;
    color:var(--plum);
    font-size:1rem;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    opacity:0.65;
  }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:6vh 6vw;
    position:relative;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at top left, rgba(201,166,107,0.15), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, rgba(185,74,92,0.12), transparent 55%),
      var(--cream);
  }
  .eyebrow{
    letter-spacing:0.35em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    font-size:0.75rem;
    color:var(--sage);
    margin-bottom:1.2rem;
    opacity:0;
    animation:fadeUp 1s ease forwards;
    animation-delay:0.2s;
  }
  h1.name{
    font-family:'Dancing Script', cursive;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(3.2rem, 11vw, 7.5rem);
    color:var(--rose);
    margin:0 0 0.3rem 0;
    line-height:1;
    opacity:0;
    animation:fadeUp 1s ease forwards;
    animation-delay:0.4s;
  }
  .subtitle{
    font-size:clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
    font-style:italic;
    color:var(--plum);
    margin:0.4rem 0 2.2rem 0;
    opacity:0;
    animation:fadeUp 1s ease forwards;
    animation-delay:0.65s;
  }
  .divider{
    width:120px;
    height:1px;
    background:var(--gold);
    margin:0 auto 2.2rem auto;
    position:relative;
    opacity:0;
    animation:fadeUp 1s ease forwards;
    animation-delay:0.85s;
  }
  .divider::before{
    content:"❀";
    position:absolute;
    top:50%; left:50%;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    background:var(--cream);
    padding:0 12px;
    color:var(--sage);
    font-size:1rem;
  }
  .message{
    max-width:560px;
    font-size:clamp(1.15rem, 2.4vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height:1.75;
    color:var(--plum);
    opacity:0;
    animation:fadeUp 1s ease forwards;
    animation-delay:1.05s;
  }
  @keyframes fadeUp{
    from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(18px);}
    to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}
  }

  .scroll-cue{
    position:absolute;
    bottom:6vh;
    font-size:0.8rem;
    letter-spacing:0.3em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--sage);
    opacity:0;
    animation:fadeUp 1s ease forwards, bob 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
    animation-delay:1.4s, 2.4s;
  }
  @keyframes bob{
    0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}
    50%{transform:translateY(8px);}
  }

  /* ---------- REASONS SECTION ---------- */
  .reasons{
    padding:10vh 6vw;
    display:grid;
    gap:2.5rem;
    max-width:900px;
    margin:0 auto;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
  }
  .reason-card{
    padding:2.2rem 1.8rem;
    border:1px solid rgba(198,165,103,0.4);
    border-radius:2px;
    background:var(--blush);
    position:relative;
  }
  .reason-num{
    font-family:'Dancing Script', cursive;
    font-size:2.2rem;
    color:var(--rose);
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:0.6rem;
  }
  .reason-card p{
    font-size:1.15rem;
    line-height:1.6;
    margin:0;
  }

  /* ---------- CLOSING ---------- */
  .closing{
    text-align:center;
    padding:12vh 6vw 14vh 6vw;
    background:var(--plum);
    color:var(--cream);
  }
  .closing .signoff{
    font-family:'Dancing Script', cursive;
    font-size:clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 3.6rem);
    color:var(--gold);
    margin-bottom:0.5rem;
  }
  .closing p{
    font-size:1.2rem;
    opacity:0.85;
    max-width:480px;
    margin:0 auto;
  }
  .footer-note{
    margin-top:3rem;
    font-size:0.75rem;
    letter-spacing:0.2em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    opacity:0.5;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="envelope-stage">
  <div class="envelope" id="envelope">
    <div class="env-body"></div>
    <div class="env-flap"></div>
    <div class="seal">L</div>
    <div class="env-hint">tap to open</div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="hero">
  <span class="eyebrow">A little note for</span>
  <h1 class="name">Lipsita</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Happy Girlfriend Day</p>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <p class="message">
    Today's just an excuse to say out loud what I already know every day —
    being with you makes ordinary moments feel like the best part of my life.
    Here's to you, Lipsita, and to us.
  </p>
  <div class="scroll-cue">scroll down ↓</div>
</section>

<section class="reasons">
  <div class="reason-card">
    <span class="reason-num">01</span>
    <p>The way you laugh at your own jokes before you even finish telling them.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="reason-card">
    <span class="reason-num">02</span>
    <p>How you make even a boring Tuesday feel like something worth looking forward to.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="reason-card">
    <span class="reason-num">03</span>
    <p>You listen — really listen — and somehow that's the rarest, kindest thing.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="reason-card">
    <span class="reason-num">04</span>
    <p>Every plan feels better the moment I know you're going to be there too.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="closing">
  <div class="signoff">Happy Girlfriend Day, Lipsita</div>
  <p>Thank you for being exactly who you are. I'm lucky to love you.</p>
  <div class="footer-note">made with love</div>
</section>

<script>
  const envelope = document.getElementById('envelope');
  const stage = document.getElementById('envelope-stage');
  envelope.addEventListener('click', () => {
    envelope.classList.add('open');
    setTimeout(() => stage.classList.add('hidden'), 900);
  });
</script>

</body>
</html>
